/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (I split the program into separate functions that each do exactly one job. showBoard\(\) prints the grid, checkWin\(\) checks all 8 win conditions, spotOpen\(\) validates a move, and getAIMove\(\) handles the entire Ollama side. I designed it this way so the code is easy to read and if something breaks I know exactly which function to look at.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
