/P 113 0 R
/E (If statements control almost every decision in the game. checkWin\(\) has 8 of them covering every row, column, and diagonal. spotOpen\(\) checks if a spot is in range and not taken. There is also input validation using cin.fail\(\) - if the player types a letter instead of a number it catches it and asks them to try again instead of crashing.)
